@ 29.1.1.1.15 - Proto-Athabaskan to Upper Koyukon
# citation: Whimemsz, from Krauss, Michael and Victor Golla (1981), “Northern Athapaskan
# 			Languages”. Handbook of North American Indians, Vol. 6 (Subarctic), 67 – 85
	e a ɑ ʊ > a o ŏ ŭ
	t͡s {TŠ,TŠʷ} > TŁ t͡s
	# Stem-final/suffixal consonant clusters lost in Minchumina-Bearpaw Upper Koyukon
	[+ cons, - fr, + bk, + hi, - lo] > TŠ
	C’ > C / _$
	Vˀ > V:[+low tone]
	V:[+low tone] > V:[-tone]
	w > m / _Vn
	w > b